        "original_id": "b8c67984-786e-5c05-bc6a-29f2b5e0e37e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Franchises/Series: How to Train Your Dragon\n- Short films: Legend of the Boneknapper Dragon, Book of Dragons, Gift of the Night Fury, Dawn of the Dragon Racers\n- People: Cressida Cowell\n- Companies: DreamWorks Animation\n- Films: The Road to El Dorado\n\nFacts:\n- The Road to El Dorado is a 2000 American animated adventure musical fantasy comedy film produced by DreamWorks Animation.\n- Legend of the Boneknapper Dragon is a 2010 animated short film by DreamWorks Animation and a sequel to the feature film How to Train Your Dragon.\n- The How to Train Your Dragon franchise includes four short films: Legend of the Boneknapper Dragon (2010), Book of Dragons (2011), Gift of the Night Fury (2011), and Dawn of the Dragon Racers (2014).\n- Cressida Cowell, born on 15 April 1966, is an English children's author known for the How to Train Your Dragon novel series.\n- DreamWorks Animation adapted Cressida Cowell's How to Train Your Dragon books into an award-winning screen franchise.",
